ty&rsquo;s 4 grids, January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 38 years. In 2025 January to February came in at 30% of normal on the middle, and November to December at 39%. Grid 24436 shows a preliminary 149.7 for August to September 2026, an estimate that can differ from RMA&rsquo;s final index.</p>"}
